sequenceDiagram
    participant Team as CubeSat team
    participant ISED as ISED Canada
    participant ITU as ITU
    participant IARU as IARU

    Team->>ISED: Send mission summary and proposed frequencies
    ISED-->>Team: Provide licensing and filing guidance
    Team->>Team: Develop mission, RF, and ground station plans

    Team->>ISED: Submit prepared API through e-Submission
    ISED->>ITU: Forward API as Canadian administration
    ITU-->>ISED: Publish API
    ISED-->>Team: Provide API publication reference

    Team->>IARU: Request coordination with mission and RF details
    IARU-->>Team: Recommend coordinated frequencies
    Team->>ISED: Submit spacecraft licence application through SMS
    ISED->>ISED: Review technical and operational information

    Team->>ISED: Update technical file with coordinated frequencies
    ISED-->>Team: Grant spacecraft spectrum licence

    Team->>ISED: Provide final frequency-assignment notification data
    ISED->>ITU: Submit Article 11 notification before launch
    ITU-->>ISED: Acknowledge receipt and process notification

    Team->>ISED: Apply for TT&C ground station spectrum licence
    ISED->>ISED: Begin assessment
    Team->>ISED: Submit site approval application with engineer-certified data
    ISED-->>Team: Grant ground station licence and site approval

    Team->>ISED: Request change from pre-operational to operational licence status<br/>at least 60 calendar days before anticipated launch
    ISED-->>Team: Approve operational status when licence conditions are met

    Team->>Team: Launch and deploy CubeSat
    Team->>Team: Operate CubeSat and ground station within licences

    Team->>ISED: Report actual orbit and date of bringing into use
    ISED->>ITU: Submit confirmation of actual bringing into use
